Speedrunning consists of trying to accomplish a specific goal in a game within a set of parameters as quickly as possible.

If you are looking to experience [[Old School RuneScape]] in a new and interesting way, speedrunning offers a surprisingly unique, challenging, and rewarding view of game.

This page provides information on the [[Guide:Speedrunning guide#Categories|speedrunning categories]] that are hosted on [https://www.speedrun.com/osrs Speedrun.com]. These categories are what the community has shown to be the most interesting sets of repeatable "goals" in [[Old School RuneScape]]. However, the categories are always open to be modified or expanded as the community sees fit.

